WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.718
A completed campaign can export its call report

00:00:06.718 --> 00:00:11.203
Open Filters and pick a Status

00:00:11.203 --> 00:00:13.640
Click a campaign to open its details

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.206
Status, assistant, call time and retries

00:00:15.206 --> 00:00:21.268
Analytics: this campaign's calls and outcomes

00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:23.547
Click Manage concurrency

00:00:23.547 --> 00:00:26.314
Workspace tab: split API calls and campaigns

00:00:26.314 --> 00:00:30.039
Campaigns tab: a share for each ongoing campaign

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:32.406
Click Save (saves the open tab)

00:00:32.406 --> 00:00:37.064
Terminate stops all future calls, after a confirm

00:00:37.064 --> 00:00:40.224
Click History to see the campaign's calls in Logs

00:00:40.224 --> 00:00:43.734
Logs, filtered to this campaign
